fixture second_ember_grants_an_air_dash
doc BUILD.md s8 Tiers, Second Ember: "pogo bounces grant 1 extra air dash per stack" (content/votives/second_ember.tres; docs/adr/0015). Ash drops onto the dummy with the down-strike: the bounce leaves two air dashes, its proc shows, and both are dashed. Control: second_ember_control.
room test/dummy_pogo
spawn 300 460
option votive_second_ember 1
frames 60
input
  0 D attack
  20 R dash
  33 R dash
end
expect
  mark bounce 0..12 event.pogo=1
  at bounce air_dashes=2 event.proc=1 proc.second_ember=1
  at 20 event.dash=1 air_dashes=1
  at 33 event.dash=1 air_dashes=0
end
